WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Interviewer>Tell me about your experience with TypeScript.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Alice Smith>I've been using TypeScript for three years. I really enjoy the type safety it provides, especially for large codebases.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Interviewer>Can you give me an example of a complex type you've worked with?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Alice Smith>Sure. I built a generic event bus with conditional types and inferred payloads. It ensured type-safe event dispatch across our entire monorepo.
